Z||000002||TWEETIE BIRD||06-26-2001||06:16 AM||||It was a beautiful day. A good breeze. Most of the time it was sunny with a few clouds once in a while. It didn't rain until on our way home. I was working most of the day there <BR>and when I had a chance to take pictures it clouded up. I'll have more pics later. ||||reg||10
